    "notes": [
      "The frame title is bold in the dialog color (permission by default); titleEnd renders a space-between header whose tail truncates from the start.",
      "Subtitle presence starts the header height at 2, then the committed title column's measured height replaces it; the viewport inset is header + gap + two guide rows unless the guide is hidden.",
      "The input guide receives the exit state; a pending gesture shows `Press <key> again to exit|cancel`; with no guide the static cancel hint is used when cancel is inactive.",
      "The border renders the divider and a two-cell padded column without a viewport; inside a viewport it renders a one-cell padded column and no divider.",
      "The exit entries name app:interrupt and app:exit; a second press within 800 ms confirms, and a supplied onCancel that returns truthy suppresses the gesture."
    ]
